# A small Kest-scripted game: movers that drift and bounce.
program movers.kest

component 0d3f8a3e-7c55-4b8e-9d0e-2a61f3c4b5a1 movers.position Position
component 5b1c9e22-4f07-4d3a-8c6b-91e7d2a0f4c8 movers.velocity Velocity

system movers.integrate simulation integrate write movers.position read movers.velocity
system movers.bounce simulation bounce read movers.position write movers.velocity after movers.integrate

spawn 3 movers.position x=0 y=0 movers.velocity dx=1 dy=2
spawn 1 movers.position x=99.5 y=0 movers.velocity dx=1 dy=0
